From: openEuler RISC-V packaging <packaging@openeuler.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] rfc3195: retain the implicit-int helper return explicitly

Retain the existing package's GCC 14 declaration repair as a reviewable
source patch. Only make the old implicit int explicit; preserve the helper
body, all error/status returns and the original CRLF source line endings.
This is not a RISC-V-specific defect or a change to frame parsing.

